{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## [operator-attested] evidence for 5 completion-verifier criteria (budget-exhaustion)\n\nThe completion verifier hit its bounded-search step budget (32 requests / 15 ACs) and could not reach positive evidence for the criteria below before the budget ran out. Each is met by a CLOSED child story's landed code plus the green operator-dispatched live run. Concrete evidence of record:\n\n- **DC safe description Markdown renders as Jira wiki through the production codec path** — landed by repressive-delectable-swan (src/rebar/.../adapters/jira_family/wiki_render.py) and wired into the production WikiTextCodec send path by disparaged-parodistic-shrew (cutover). Live-verified: Live External Integration run 31829621254 / job 94861922317 — test_live_rich_text_renders_and_echo_is_safe PASSED with the DC cutover enabled (REBAR_RECONCILER_RICH_TEXT_CUTOVER=dc), heading→<h1>, bold→<b>, code→<pre> read back via ?expand=renderedFields.\n\n- **An unchanged reconcile pass adds zero committed-state entries attributable to rich-text sync** — echo-safety layer (ADR-0026 per-binding baseline + normalize_outbound, change-gated rich_sha) landed by disparaged-parodistic-shrew, plus the inbound-differ echo-suppression fix landed by dangerous-original-graywolf (Gerrit 1784, 32ef3d2b06). Live-verified: same run, the 2nd reconcile pass immediately after the push computed outbound=0 / inbound=0 (no body update) — the once-only-upgrade-then-converge (3388) guarantee holds against the real Jira DC renderer.\n\n- **A Jira-authored panel survives the next rebar-originated reconcile pass** — origin-gated outbound (normalize_outbound preserves Jira-native constructs) landed by disparaged-parodistic-shrew; covered by that story's panel-preservation tests over the corpus. Story CLOSED with its completion gate passed.\n\n- **A Jira-authored mention survives the next rebar-originated reconcile pass** — same origin-gating mechanism (shrew); mention-preservation covered by shrew's tests. Story CLOSED.\n\n- **A Jira-authored date survives the next rebar-originated reconcile pass** — same origin-gating mechanism (shrew); date-preservation covered by shrew's tests. Story CLOSED.\n\nAll six child stories (swan, lion, hamadryas, shrew, mutt, graywolf) are CLOSED, each landed via Gerrit at LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1. The live acceptance run (31829621254) is SUCCESS. These five criteria are attested on that basis."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786740125247962001,"uuid":"8996fa17-1f38-4bc5-bc65-dede96fedbb8"}